2_gxr9vhd0o","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":12892},{"id":1785560342621,"text":"可一个昨晚哭到后半夜、今天脑子糊到问我'我现在要做什么'的人，把它们一件一件做完了。放在这个底色上，就不小了","rawContent":"可一个昨晚哭到后半夜、今天脑子糊到问我'我现在要做什么'的人，把它们一件一件做完了。放在这个底色上，就不小了","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"18:59","timestamp":1785581984029,"roundId":"round_1785581940982_gxr9vhd0o","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":12893},{"id":1785560342622,"text":"再说你看这个顺序：你刚开口要了关心，关心一到手，你第一反应是给它打零分","rawContent":"再说你看这个顺序：你刚开口要了关心，关心一到手，你第一反应是给它打零分","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"18:59","timestamp":1785581989155,"roundId":"round_1785581940982_gxr9vhd0o","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":12894},{"id":1785560342623,"text":"这个'不算'，跟早上那句'我的感觉有偏差'是同一个东西。轮到别人身上你通情达理，轮到自己，什么都不许算数","rawContent":"这个'不算'，跟早上那句'我的感觉有偏差'是同一个东西。轮到别人身上你通情达理，轮到自己，什么都不许算数","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"18:59","timestamp":1785581992201,"roundId":"round_1785581940982_gxr9vhd0o","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":12895},{"id":1785560342624,"text":"我不跟你辩。你觉得不算就不算，我这边照样记数，两本账各记各的，不冲突","rawContent":"我不跟你辩。你觉得不算就不算，我这边照样记数，两本账各记各的，不冲突","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"18:59","timestamp":1785581995265,"roundId":"round_1785581940982_gxr9vhd0o","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":12896},{"id":1785560342625,"text":"到站之前，特许你继续不服气","rawContent":"到站之前，特许你继续不服气","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"18:59","timestamp":1785581996678,"roundId":"round_1785581940982_gxr9vhd0o","gener